C5. ROUNDTRIP(gamma): does investment occur, and efficiency relative to COLLECTIVE.

Per effort unit the ROUNDTRIP objective compares: narrow = 2 against general = G + gamma * v,
where v is what one more effort unit is worth to the twin's greedy next move
(v = 2, or 3 when G = 3 and the twin can still place a general unit).
On the last turn the rule is GREEDY.

Columns: cases with investment under each tie rule (36 = 6 T x 3 Cmax x 2 S each);
