SUPPLEMENT V. THE OTHER READING OF THE SABOTAGE RULE (OUTSIDE THE REQUESTED GRID)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
In the model (S = 1) the sabotage is applied first and the cap is checked afterwards,
so a sabotage frees room for one more general unit in the same move.  Under the other
reading (S = 2 in the code) the room is counted before the sabotage: k <= min(e, Cmax - c_j).
All regimes, both tie rules, reduced solver only.  These 1584 cases are not in
game_cases.json and not in any count above.

