Columns: parameters; k = general units per turn; sab = sabotage per turn; e = effort per turn;
gA, gB = general units placed by A and by B; sb = sabotage events; end = fA,cA,fB,cB;
score = fA + fB; FB = first-best; eff = score / FB; tie-diff = Y if the path differs
between the two tie rules.

